{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"28":{"eng-name":"Foods (Kitab Al-At'imah)","ara-name":"كتاب الأطعمة"}},"section_detail":{"28":{"hadithnumber_first":3736,"hadithnumber_last":3854,"arabicnumber_first":3736,"arabicnumber_last":3854}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3812,"arabicnumber":3812,"text":"Abu Ya’fur a dit : J’ai entendu Ibn Abi Awfa dire, quand je l’ai interrogé sur la consommation des sauterelles : « J’ai participé à six ou sept expéditions avec le Messager d’Allah ﷺ et nous en avons mangé avec lui. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (5495) Sahih Muslim (1952)"}],"reference":{"book":28,"hadith":77},"chapter":{"id":35,"ara-name":"باب فِي أَكْلِ الْجَرَادِ","eng-name":"Regarding eating locusts","isFirstHadith":true}}]}